===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*fregnaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*preḱ-||to ask}}. Cognate with {{etyl|osx|-}} {{m|osx|fregnan}}, {{etyl|non|-}} {{m|non|fregna}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐍆𐍂𐌰𐌹𐌷𐌽𐌰𐌽}}, and related to {{etyl|goh|-}} {{m|goh|frāga}} ({{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|Frage}}).  The Indo-European root also gave {{etyl|peo|-}} {{m|peo|||tr=aparsam|I asked}}, {{etyl|sga|-}} {{m|sga|arcaid}}, {{etyl|wlm|-}} {{m|wlm|archaf}}, {{etyl|xcl|-}} {{m|xcl|հարց}}, {{etyl|xto|-}} {{m|xto|prak-}}, {{etyl|txb|-}} {{m|txb|prek-}}.

